e page shows. --><div class="kwrap"><div class="ticker-band today-skyline"><p class="skyticker" aria-label="Sky positions for Nov 5, 2026 at 12:00 UTC"><span class="skyticker__label">Thursday, Nov 5 · 12 UTC</span><span class="skyticker__item skyticker__item--sun"><span class="skyticker__icon skyticker__icon--disc"><img src="/assets/zodiac-icons/48/scorpio.webp" width="18" height="18" alt decoding="async"/></span><span>Sun 13°04′ Scorpio</span></span><span class="skyticker__item skyticker__item--moon"><span class="skyticker__icon skyticker__icon--disc"><img src="/assets/zodiac-icons/48/virgo.webp" width="18" height="18" alt decoding="async"/></span><span>Moon in Virgo</span></span><span class="skyticker__item skyticker__item--retro"><span class="skyticker__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 2.6-6.3L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg></span><span>Mercury retrograde</span></span><span class="skyticker__item skyticker__item--retro"><span class="skyticker__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 2.6-6.3L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg></span><span>Venus, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune retrograde</span></span><span class="skyticker__item skyticker__item--newMoon"><span class="skyticker__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.2"></circle></svg></span><span>New moon · Nov 9</span></span></p></div></div><!-- 3. The two lights, in the site's own sign art, and the lunar cycle. --><section class="kwrap today-sec" aria-labelledby="today-lights-heading"><div class="section-head--row today-head"><div><span class="kicker">Where the day starts</span><h2 id="today-lights-heading" class="h-2">The Sun and the Moon</h2><p>The two lights astrology begins with: where they are today, and what their signs have traditionally stood for.</p></div><a class="textlink only-desktop" href="/moon-phase/">Tonight’s moon, in detail <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="today-lights"><article class="today-light" style="--sign:#B9DCE8"><div class="today-light__art"><figure class="artframe" style="--focus:50% 40%;--spot:48% 52%"><img src="/assets/sign-art/scorpio-1200.webp" srcset="/assets/sign-art/scorpio-720.webp 720w, /assets/sign-art/scorpio-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 761px) 600px, calc(100vw - 40px)" width="1200" height="800" alt="Illustrated scorpion with a raised tail in side profile, standing on an ornate bronze and black zodiac dial" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><span class="today-light__tag">Sun · 13°04′</span></div><div class="today-light__body"><div class="today-light__head"><picture class="sign-icon" style="--sign:#B9DCE8;--sign-size:46px" data-astro-cid-bhbtnphv><source srcset="/assets/zodiac-icons/128/scorpio.avif" class="astro-bhbtnphv" type="image/avif" data-astro-cid-bhbtnphv><img src="/assets/zodiac-icons/128/scorpio.webp" class="astro-bhbtnphv" width="46" height="46" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-bhbtnphv></picture><h3 class="h-3">Sun in Scorpio</h3></div><p>Intense, private, all-or-nothing. The Sun is in the middle third of the sign and enters Sagittarius on Nov 22.</p><p class="kfacts"><span>Oct 23 to Nov 21</span><span>Fixed water</span><span class="today-hide-m">Ruled by Pluto</span></p></div></article><article class="today-light" style="--sign:#B7D9B0"><div class="today-light__art"><figure class="artframe" style="--focus:50% 40%;--spot:52% 52%"><img src="/assets/sign-art/virgo-1200.webp" srcset="/assets/sign-art/virgo-720.webp 720w, /assets/sign-art/virgo-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 761px) 600px, calc(100vw - 40px)" width="1200" height="800" alt="Illustrated maiden holding a sheaf of wheat in side profile, standing on an ornate bronze and black zodiac dial" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><span class="today-light__tag">Moon · 28°33′ · 14% lit</span></div><div class="today-light__body"><div class="today-light__head"><picture class="sign-icon" style="--sign:#B7D9B0;--sign-size:46px" data-astro-cid-bhbtnphv><source srcset="/assets/zodiac-icons/128/virgo.avif" class="astro-bhbtnphv" type="image/avif" data-astro-cid-bhbtnphv><img src="/assets/zodiac-icons/128/virgo.webp" class="astro-bhbtnphv" width="46" height="46" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-bhbtnphv></picture><h3 class="h-3">Moon in Virgo</h3></div><p>Precise, useful, quietly running the whole operation. The Moon is 25.8 days past the new moon.</p><p class="kfacts"><span>Waning crescent</span><span>25.8 days old</span><span class="today-hide-m">Mutable earth</span></p></div></article></div><ol class="today-cycle" aria-label="This lunar cycle" style="--nodes:4"><li><svg class="today-moon" viewBox="-24 -24 48 48" width="46" height="46" aria-hidden="true"><circle r="20" fill="#1C2130" stroke="rgba(198,204,218,0.22)" stroke-width="1"></circle></svg><b>New moon</b><span>Oct 10<span class="today-cycle__sign">Libra</span></span></li><li><svg class="today-moon" viewBox="-24 -24 48 48" width="46" height="46" aria-hidden="true"><circle r="20" fill="#1C2130" stroke="rgba(198,204,218,0.22)" stroke-width="1"></circle><circle r="20" fill="#E6E2D6"></circle></svg><b>Full moon</b><span>Oct 26<span class="today-cycle__sign">Taurus</span></span></li><li class="is-now"><svg class="today-moon" viewBox="-24 -24 48 48" width="46" height="46" aria-hidden="true"><circle r="20" fill="#1C2130" stroke="rgba(198,204,218,0.22)" stroke-width="1"></circle><path d="M0,-20 A20,20 0 0 0 0,20 A14.28,20 0 0 1 0,-20 Z" fill="#E6E2D6"></path></svg><b><span data-edition-current-only>Today</span><span data-edition-dated-only>Nov 5</span></b><span>Waning crescent</span></li><li><svg class="today-moon" viewBox="-24 -24 48 48" width="46" height="46" aria-hidden="true"><circle r="20" fill="#1C2130" stroke="rgba(198,204,218,0.22)" stroke-width="1"></circle></svg><b>New moon</b><span>Nov 9<span class="today-cycle__sign">Scorpio</span></span></li></ol></section><!-- 4. The Moon from each Sun sign, and the version that is only yours.
